\layout ShortFoilhead

Smaller Vulnerable period
\layout Standard

The smaller vulnerable period leads to a greater maximum throughput which
 is now found at 
\begin_inset Formula $G=1$
\end_inset 

.
 The maximum throughput is 
\begin_inset Formula $\frac{1}{e}$
\end_inset 

.
 Slotted ALOHA therefore can be twice as efficient as pure ALOHA.
 
\layout ShortFoilhead

